      en: ["Sanctuary located near the city of Keren.", "Home to Dorcas gazelles and Klipspringer antelopes.", "Landscape features acacia trees and mountains.", "Critical ecological corridor in northern Eritrea.", "Scientific monitoring of species health and growth.", "Focus on preventing illegal hunting and poaching."],
